        {
          "type": "tool",
          "data": {
            "content": "[{\"namespace\":[\"memories\",\"baseline-run0-f62aac\"],\"key\":\"c50dc77f-b343-4675-8904-317b72eecc14\",\"value\":{\"content\":\"Weaviate is an open-source vector database with a GraphQL-flavored API. It offers self-hosting via Docker/K8s, a managed cloud option, and a commercial tier for advanced features. It provides strong performance with p95 ~15ms at 10M vectors and 96% recall. Its hybrid search (BM25+vector) is a standout feature. However, it has a heavier operational footprint, a complex module system, and a GraphQL API that is a new paradigm for the team.\"},\"created_at\":\"2026-08-12T01:18:26.507191+00:00\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-12T01:18:26.507191+00:00\",\"score\":0.6469367567377338}]",
            "additional_kwargs": {},
            "response_metadata": {},
            "type": "tool",
            "name": "search_memory",
            "id": "3ff37fc7-db10-4f07-aa00-a16fc123c6e5",
            "tool_call_id": "33e324e3-e906-4cc4-8c63-89aee20bf0d8",
            "artifact": null,
            "status": "success"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "ai",
          "data": {
            "content": "Based on our constraints and the evaluation of the vector databases, **Weaviate** is the most suitable choice. Here's why:\n\n1. **Hybrid Search Capabilities**: Weaviate supports both BM25 and vector search, which is ideal for our requirement of combining traditional keyword search with vector-based similarity search.\n\n2. **Performance**: It offers strong performance with a p95 latency of ~15ms at 10 million vectors and 96% recall, which aligns well with our performance expectations.\n\n3. **Deployment Options**: Weaviate provides both self-hosting options (via Docker/K8s) and a managed cloud option, offering flexibility in deployment that fits our infrastructure needs.\n\n4. **Advanced Features**: The commercial tier of Weaviate includes advanced features that could be beneficial for future scalability and enhanced functionality.\n\nWhile Weaviate has a more complex module system and a GraphQL API that may require some learning curve, these trade-offs are justified by its robust feature set and performance, which align well with our constraints.",
            "additional_kwargs": {},
